{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/782676-could-use-some-ideas-for-a-cipher","id":782676,"title":"Could use some ideas for a Cipher","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-09T01:03:35-08:00","id":782676,"title":"Could use some ideas for a Cipher","content":"So, a new player joined my Demon game yesterday, and since the rest of the group have already discovered the first interlocks in their power, I was planning to let this new player catch up to them a bit, likely by giving her access to her first interlock right away, or at least a bit quicker than regular. She's playing a curious Messenger / Inquisitor.<br /> <br /> Her initial Embed is Loose Lips, and the following one will be Authorized, so I was considering something regarding rumor spreading at work places, but haven't really planned out any details yet, so figured I should check here to see if I could get some inspiration.<br /> <br /> If you have any good ideas for following Interlocks that would obviously be interesting as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/586-gurrgel","name":"Gurrgel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T02:36:48-08:00","id":782701,"title":"","content":"What are the broad strokes of her concept and playstyle? More information about what kind of powers might play well to her style and what kind of themes seem relevant might help.<br /> <br /> Loose Lips extracts information through entertainments and social engagements, and Authorized fabricates the right to be in a place. The first idea that strikes me off the top of my head works with the former's interesting focus on having to keep your subject occupied with amusements, and the latter's forgery of titles and roles. It'd be fun to take that into a game space: the ol' devil's golden fiddle bit. If she engages someone in any kind of friendly competition \u2013 word games, table tennis, a hand of poker \u2013 and beats them, she can choose to copy a facade (Flowers of Hell, p. 35) off of them for some short duration of time, perhaps based on how much effort the competition involved (a golf tournament is worth a much longer privilege than a simple game of rock-paper-scissors).<br /> <br /> That may or may not fit her concept, but I had the thought reading your post and felt it was interesting enough to share either way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T02:41:36-08:00","id":782702,"title":"","content":"Alternatively you could have the interlock treat such competitions as social maneuvering. Convince the gangster to start providing you with drugs over a game of darts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T03:00:21-08:00","id":782710,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the response, and sorry if my initial post was a bit brief, I realised I was running late for work so I figured it was better to post it and then update it from work.<br /> <br /> Since she's just created her character last night, and we only had time to play for an hour or so, her character is not fully fleshed out yet, but this is what I've gotten from her character so far:<br /> She's probably the most social character in the group, and her initial Embeds are focused on that as well (Authorized, Loose Lips, Freudian Slip and Muse), she's focused on Socialize / Persuasion and less so on Subterfuge / Intimidation. She's also quite curious and perceptive, with good perception and Investigation scores. She's not a very physical character (2 or 3 in Stealth / Larceny, 1 in Firearms that I can remember from work without her character sheet at hand) and has limited but some mental skills (mostly in academics from what I recall).<br /> <br /> Her initial cover, which she took shortly after falling, is that of a female college student who was quite depressed and about to take her life when she was offered a more peaceful way to get away from all her suffering (through a soul pact). While her cover is in a bit of a dark place currently, the demonic persona behind that is a much more positive and upbeat personality, I'd probably say that she's an Inquisitor / Tempter rather than just an Inquisitor, and she's planning to modify her cover into something that suits her own more positive and curious personality a bit better. She currently wants to experience life and see what it has to offer without being forced to follow orders from the Machine, but I'm not currently sure if that will stick around or if that's just her expressing her newfound freedom.<br /> <br /> Either way I like your idea for an Interlock, I don't have Flowers of Hell available right now but I believe Facades are the short term / simpler covers described in FoH, no? If I remember correctly, that could definitely work, either for this Interlock, or otherwise for a future interlock that's a mix of Authorized and another Embed (Identity Theft?).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/586-gurrgel","name":"Gurrgel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}